## STEP 4 — GLOBAL MESSAGES PANEL
Messages tab in sidebar surfaces a global aggregated 
inbox of all referral message threads.
Unread threads surface to top.
Clicking a thread opens message context in a right panel.
Messages source of truth remains inside each referral modal.
This is a surface layer only, not a separate data store.
Internal staff messages and referral source messages 
appear in same thread, visually distinguished by 
sender type.
Use Supabase real-time subscription for live updates.
Do not create a new messages table if one already exists.

